{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16070","headline":"杜中丞书院新移小竹 · 王建","name":"杜中丞书院新移小竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此地本无竹，远从山寺移。\n经年求养法，隔日记浇时。\n嫩绿卷新叶，残黄收故枝。\n色轻寒不动，声与静相宜。\n爱护出常数，稀稠看自知。\n贫来缘未有，客散独行迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16070.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16070","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}